###> bot-blocker trust cookie ###
# HMAC secret shared with the bot-blocker Traefik sidecar — signs the
# __bb_trust (trusted logged-in human) cookie; the sidecar also signs its
# __bb_pass challenge cookie with it (domain-separated payloads).
# Empty = feature silently disabled. Production gets the real value from the
# deployment env (Infisical-rendered .env on lily.srv); this default only
# keeps dev/CI containers booting (see docs/features/feature_flags.md for
# why defaults must live in this committed file).
CHALLENGE_COOKIE_SECRET=
###< bot-blocker trust cookie ###
